:: Day Report [interaction] {"position":"575,2500","size":"100,100"}
/* Her end-of-day report: the "How was your day?" card of the NPC Interaction screen (id dayReport, Define Interactions),
   also reached through the highlighted sidebar quick link (Define Quick Links). How it works is in "End-of-day report" in
   Define NPCs. She sums up whatever she hasn't told me yet today, one line per entry, in her own words (those entries are
   marked told), and below that the stories with a POV passage are listed as cards: one click plays it, and <<EndPov>>
   brings me back here ($povReturn). Stories I already heard stay in the list, quieter, and can be heard again.
   The Relation comes once a day (_npc.reportDay). Coming back from a POV passage only shows the list again. */
<<silent>>
<<set _npc to ($interactionCharacter == "mom" ? $mom : $sister)>>
<<set _drEntries to setup.dayReportEntries(_npc)>>
<<set _drNew to _drEntries.filter((r) => !r.told)>>
<<set _drFirstToday to (_npc.reportDay !== $date.dayCount)>>
<<run State.variables[_npc.sysName].reportDay = State.variables.date.dayCount>>
<<run _drNew.forEach((r) => { State.variables[_npc.sysName].dayLog[r.index].told = true; })>>
<<set _drStories to _drEntries.filter((r) => r.passage)>>
<<set _drOpen to _drStories.filter((r) => !r.heard)>>
<<set _drStat to (_npc.sysName == "mom" ? "MomRelation" : "SisterRelation")>>
/* link texts may contain variables ("Ask about $brian.name"), so they are rendered to plain text first */
<<set _drText to ((markup) => jQuery(document.createElement("span")).wiki(markup).text())>>
<</silent>>
<<if _drNew.length > 0>>
	<<if !_drFirstToday>>
		<<if _npc.sysName == "mom">>
		$mom.callName catches my eye and holds up a finger before I can say anything. Something else happened since we last talked, and she has clearly been saving it up for me.
		<<else>>
		$sister.callName waves me over before I've even sat down properly. Apparently the day wasn't done with her yet, and she sounds pleased about it.
		<</if>>
	<<elseif _npc.sysName == "mom">>
		<<if random(0, 1) == 0>>
		When I ask about her day, $mom.callName looks up like I've handed her a present. She smooths her skirt over her knees and starts at the beginning, the way she used to tell $dad.callName about hers over dinner, back when he still asked.
		<<else>>
		I ask how her day has been, and she actually stops what she's doing to think about it. She has been hoping somebody would ask, and now that I have, she wants to get it right.
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<if random(0, 1) == 0>>
		I ask how her day has been, and $sister.callName pulls her feet up and gets comfortable, which is how I know this is going to take a while. She's been waiting for an audience.
		<<else>>
		She starts talking before I've finished the question, stops herself, laughs, and starts over at the beginning, properly this time.
		<</if>>
	<</if>>

	<<set _msgs to _drNew.map((r) => ({ who: _npc, text: r.line }))>>
	<<Chat _msgs>>

	<<if _drFirstToday>><<UpdateStat "+" _drStat 1>><</if>>
<<elseif _drOpen.length > 0>>
	<<= _npc.callName>> is still there, waiting to see if I want to hear the rest of it.
<<else>>
	That's everything, as far as <<= _npc.callName>> is concerned, and she looks pleased with herself for remembering all of it.
<</if>>

<<nobr>>
<<if _drStories.length > 0>>
<div class="dr">
	<div class="dr-head">
		<span class="dr-title">Ask her about</span>
		<span class="dr-count"><<= _drOpen.length>> of <<= _drStories.length>> not heard yet</span>
	</div>
	<div class="dr-list">
		<<for _dr range _drStories>>
			<<capture _dr>>
			<div @class="'dr-item' + (_dr.heard ? ' heard' : '')">
				<span class="dr-icon" aria-hidden="true"><<if _dr.heard>>&#10003;<<else>>&#9656;<</if>></span>
				<span class="dr-body">
					<<link `_drText(_dr.ask)`>>
						<<set State.variables[_npc.sysName].dayLog[_dr.index].heard to true>>
						<<set $povReturn to "Day Report">>
						<<goto _dr.passage>>
					<</link>>
					<span class="dr-line"><<= _dr.line>></span>
				</span>
				<<if _dr.heard>><span class="dr-badge">Heard</span><<else>><span class="dr-badge new">New</span><</if>>
			</div>
			<</capture>>
		<</for>>
	</div>
</div>
<</if>>

<div class="dr-foot"><<link "That's enough for today" "NPC Interaction">><</link>></div>

<style>
.dr { max-width: 40rem; margin: 1rem auto 0; padding: .7rem .8rem .8rem; border: 1px solid var(--card-border); border-radius: .8em; background: var(--card-bg); backdrop-filter: blur(6px); text-align: left; }
.dr-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: .5rem; padding-bottom: .35rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--card-border); }
.dr-title { font-size: .68rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .25em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent); }
.dr-count { font-size: .72em; color: rgba(235,221,197,.6); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.dr-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .35rem; }

/* one story: the whole row is clickable (the link stretches over it) */
.dr-item { position: relative; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.4rem 1fr auto; align-items: start; column-gap: .55rem; padding: .45rem .65rem; border: 1px solid rgba(235,221,197,.45); border-radius: .6em; background: rgba(235,221,197,.08); cursor: pointer; transition: border-color .2s, background-color .2s; }
.dr-item:hover { border-color: var(--accent); background: rgba(235,221,197,.16); }
.dr-icon { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 1.4rem; height: 1.4rem; margin-top: .05rem; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(235,221,197,.18); color: var(--accent); font-size: .75em; }
.dr-body { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .15rem; min-width: 0; }
.dr-body a { font-weight: 700; font-size: .95em; color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; }
.dr-body a::after { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; }
.dr-item:hover .dr-body a { color: #fff; }
.dr-line { font-size: .8em; line-height: 1.35; color: rgba(235,221,197,.75); }
.dr-badge { align-self: center; padding: .05rem .5rem; border-radius: 1rem; font-size: .6rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(235,221,197,.6); background: rgba(235,221,197,.08); white-space: nowrap; }
.dr-badge.new { color: #19141E; background: #EAAF4C; }

/* already heard: quieter, still clickable to hear it again */
.dr-item.heard { border-color: var(--card-border); background: transparent; }
.dr-item.heard .dr-icon { background: rgba(28,216,141,.12); color: #1cd88d; }
.dr-item.heard .dr-body a { color: rgba(235,221,197,.85); font-weight: 600; }
.dr-item.heard:hover { border-color: rgba(235,221,197,.55); background: rgba(235,221,197,.06); }

.dr-foot { max-width: 40rem; margin: .8rem auto 0; display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; font-size: .7rem; }
.dr-foot a { color: rgba(235,221,197,.75); text-decoration: none; }
.dr-foot a:hover { color: var(--accent); }
</style>
<</nobr>>
